 over $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ]$ defined above, select the correct options below.$\\,$\n$⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x),1⟩=$ \n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\nThe functions $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)$ and $g(x)=1$ \n{{field-2}}." 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397478 1072 #uuid "3d6ca311-b229-51f5-b6ee-b805697465fa" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397478 1074 "Evaluating the inner product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x),1⟩ & ={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)]}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi } \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-6\\pi )) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}(1-1) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)$ and $g(x)=1$ $\\text{are orthogonal}$ with respect to the inner product." 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397480 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397481 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1077 "field-2" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397480 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397479 1080 #uuid "199c37d6-b74a-50da-a86e-fce04acf3561" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397480 1081 "are orthogonal" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397480 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397480 1084 #uuid "8433c533-4904-5d92-885f-bbcd959dd940" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397481 1081 "are not orthogonal" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397481 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397481 1084 #uuid "7f4020d2-476a-5794-a6f2-3d8b125330ae" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397482 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397483 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [175921863