_{0}^{3}+{\\int }_{3}^{\\infty }{e}^{(1-s)t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3s}}{s}+{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{3}^{a}{e}^{(1-s)t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3s}}{s}+{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{(\\frac{{e}^{(1-s)t}}{1-s})|}_{3}^{a} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3s}}{s}+\\frac{1}{1-s}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }({e}^{(1-s)a}-{e}^{3(1-s)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3s}}{s}+\\frac{1}{1-s}\\cdot (0-{e}^{3(1-s)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3s}}{s}+\\frac{{e}^{3(1-s)}}{s-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nvalid for $s>1.$" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397566 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397567 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397568 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397569 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397570 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397571 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1077 "field-2" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397570 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397565 1080 #uuid "a55cae0b-d0e7-5c92-b5d3-5cd9673f9f43" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397566 1081 "s>3" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397566 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397566 1084 #uuid "04fdc9fb-cd44-5e0e-b22f-8f67fce82a51" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397567 1081 "s\\ge 3" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397567 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397567 1084 #uuid "cabe113f-508f-5a0e-ae94-fc0083b16c13" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397568 1081 "s\\ge 1" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [175921