o find $u,$ we substitute our ansatz into the equation, apply the product rule to the derivative term, and simplify to isolate ${u}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u{e}^{3x})}^{′}-3(u{e}^{3x}) & ={e}^{2x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{3x}+3u{e}^{3x}-3u{e}^{3x} & ={e}^{2x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{3x}+\\cancel{3u{e}^{3x}}-\\cancel{3u{e}^{3x}} & ={e}^{2x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{3x} & ={e}^{2x} \\\\ {u}^{′} & ={e}^{-x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x$ (omitting the arbitrary constant), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′} & ={e}^{-x} \\\\ \\int {u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ u & =-{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${y}_{p}=u(x){e}^{3x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p} & =u(x){e}^{3x} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}\\cdot {e}^{3x} \\\\  & =-{e}^{2x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397741 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397742 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397743 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397744 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397745 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1077 "field-2" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397745 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397740 1080 #uuid "69acc76f-e6dd-53c9-a2d7-4929026fb4c8" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397741 1081 "-{e}^{2x}" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397741 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397741 1084 #uuid "8f63dcef-6e20-5403-a462-b25bca77f0df" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397742 1081 "{e}^{x}" 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [17592186397742 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533471 17592186045585 true] [1759218639774